# 行尾：源码统一 LF，Windows 脚本保持 CRLF（双击运行才不出怪问题）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 文本类显式声明
*.py   text
*.js   text
*.json text
*.md   text
*.html text
*.css  text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.txt  text

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换/差异污染
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.vrm binary
*.task binary

# 大件（默认不进 git —— 见 .gitignore；如需 LFS 管理，把下面几行的规则改成
#   "*.pt filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text" 形式，并先 `git lfs install`）
*.safetensors binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.bin binary
*.onnx binary
*.pyd binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.lib binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.ckpt binary
*.zip binary

# 本仓库是 Windows 应用：PNG 等资产在 diff/merge 中不要自动改
*.png -diff
*.jpg -diff
*.wav -diff